window.products.push({"id":910190,"name":"Vino's Tuscany Magnetic Wine Glass Charms, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NA7PoiUKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Vino's patented magnetic design allows the stem glass charms to securely \"wrap themselves around\" the stem or handle of each glass with ease - no clumsy hooks or clasps. These clever stem glass charms offer a refreshing alternative to the lipstick-on-the glass identification method. VINO'S have perfected the art of celebration. Celebrating tends to leave many unclaimed glasses on the table. VINO'S has taken the guesswork out of the \"whose glass is whose?\" dilemma and added style and flair with Vino's magnetic stem glass charms. The closure and beads have been designed with an eye for elegant jewelry, creating beautiful and functional glassware markers. The Reserve Collection starts with three strands of sparkling beads. The beads are finished with a stylish magnetic closure to join the ends and improve the \"on - off the glass\" process. Finally, distinctive and individual charms are attached to each strand of beads.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NA7PoiUKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vino's","source_asin":"B000F4X6ZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-910190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000F4X6ZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000F4X6ZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
