window.products.push({"id":910194,"name":"Modway Flexhaven 10\" Gel Cooling Ventilated CertiPUR-US Certified Memory Foam King Mattress","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":331.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BFJmcgOpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Channel your focus into pure relaxation for the pathway to perfect sleep with the Flexhaven 10 Inch Pressure-Relief King Memory Foam Mattress. Topped with a 3\" layer of gel-infused memory foam to keep your body climate steady, this firm king mattress dissipates body heat while quickly conforming to your weight and position for ultimate comfort and support. Sleep restfully with an open-cell ventilated memory foam bed-in-a-box that relieves pressure points, reduces bounce between two sleepers, and delivers welcome relief from the aches and pains of traditional king mattresses. The Flexhaven Cooling Gel King Mattress is CertiPUR-US certified by accredited independent testing laboratories, so you can be confident that the memory foam is made without formaldehyde, ozone depleters, mercury, and other heavy metals including PBDEs, TDCPP or TCEP (”Tris”) flame retardants, and is low on VOC. This 10 inch king memory foam mattress comes vacuum-packed and rolled to fit into an easily portable box that ships directly to your doorstep. It takes 2 to 4 hours for the king gel mattress from your bed in a box to expand most of the way and a day to expand fully. This memory foam mattress includes a removable stretch knit diamond patterned cover. Use with a box spring or mattress foundation is optional. Slatted bases should be less than 3\" apart.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BFJmcgOpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modway","source_asin":"B08QV8NBSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-910194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QV8NBSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QV8NBSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":910195,"name":"Totally Bamboo South Dakota State Shaped Serving & Cutting Board, Natural Bamboo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hyit+6iGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"the State & country shaped cutting and serving boards from Totally Bamboo are a real novelty and a perfect gift for anyone who is crazy about or loyal to their native State or Homeland. These boards are ideal for entertaining and can be used as a cutting board, serving platter or simply as a conversation piece. Each board can be hung on the wall by its rustic hanging loop. easy to care for, simply hand wash with warm water and mild detergent and occasionally treat with Totally Bamboo Revitalizing mineral oil (sold separately) to extend the life and beauty of your board. For best results, season new cutting boards with Totally Bamboo Revitalizing mineral oil several times during the first month. To season, apply generous amount of oil, spread with soft clean cloth, let board sit overnight and then wash excess oil off before using. do the earth a favor, do bamboo! bamboo is one of the most renewable resources in the world, it is stronger than most hard woods and it is the fastest growing plant on our planet. It does not require any special care to grow. In fact, it is a grass that produces more oxygen than a hard wood forest of comparable size, therefore reducing carbon dioxide gases associated with climate change. It also prevents soil erosion through its widespread root system and large canopy. Totally Bamboo, the original bamboo cutting board company, creates distinctively attractive and super durable products for your kitchen and home. They encourage and support reducing the widespread practice of clear-cutting precious hard wood forests by giving consumers a sustainable alternative to products made from hard wood. Totally Bamboo, is proud to use Moso timber bamboo for its strength, density, versatility and high quality. It is harvested from their own bamboo forests which are not a habitat or food source for the great Panda. Their factories adhere to very stringent protocol for curing and processing the bamboo, ensuring the highest quality Product. They ensure that their employees are well taken care of and work in a safe and hazard free environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hyit+6iGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Totally Bamboo","source_asin":"B00FDN7RIW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-910195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FDN7RIW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FDN7RIW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
