window.products.push({"id":910248,"name":"AAJDHE Corner Shower Caddy,2-Pack Shower Organizer Corner Shower Shelf with 8 Hooks,Adhesive No Drilling Rustproof Stainless Steel Shower Shelves for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q4fsJ6uxL._AC_SL1359_.jpg","description":"100% Stainless Steel 【Large Capacity with L-shape】L-shaped design make corner shower caddy hold more,these bathroom shower shelves are designed for organizing your space, ideal for storing your shampoo, body wash, cream, soap and more. Coming with 8 hooks for brushes, sponge, razors, shower rack could find a home in the corner of a bathroom vanity or in kitchen, laundry room. 【NO DRILLING & NO DAMAGE】The shower corner shelf with the powerful adhesive hooks to ensure the shower organizer stable, it's very easy to install. Just stick it to your wall and then put your shelves on the hooks, waiting for 12 hrs and finally put your bathroom shower accessories on the shelve.Large storage shelves can make your home tidier and the storage capacity provides enough space to put most of your items. 【Premium 304 Stainless Steel Material】Shower shelf for inside shower crafts from SUS304 stainless steel. The metal wire will never rust after prolonged use and give caddy a better drainage.you will no longer worry about mold problems caused by stagnant wate The shower storage also resists to scratches and corrosion, keeping your shower items clean and tidy. 【Strong Adhesion Up to 30LBS】Each shower rack can load at least 6 full-size bottles for a long time. You can use the larger one to store kids' bath toys and the small one to organize parents' bath supplies like shampoo, sponge, body wash.The shower storage secures firmly via durable, traceless adhesive that won’t damage the shower wall. Grip tighty to smooth surfaces, no worry about falling down. 【What You Will Get】: You will get 2 different size shower shelves, 6 adhesive stickers, 8 hooks, and our best customer service. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we are always here to serve you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q4fsJ6uxL._AC_SL1359_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AAJDHE","source_asin":"B0B8CS3TCT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-910248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8CS3TCT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8CS3TCT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":910249,"name":"Crossroads Home Décor His Smile, in Memory of a Loved one, Loving Memory Gift, 6361BW","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710jqQRXdrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THESE BEAUTIFUL BREAVEMENT GIFTS will bring both comfort and a smile to those who look on it every day to see a reminder of the loved one they have lost. Add these frames to your condolence card to make a thoughtful and meaningful remembrance gifts for anyone who is suffering the loss of a husband, father, grandpa, or son. WHEN YOU DON’T KNOW WHAT TO SAY, reach out with this \"In loving memory\" picture frame. Flowers for delivery only last for a short amount of time. This frame will be a constant token of your love and support while providing a unique reminder that will touch the hearts of those who are grieving. THIS PICTURE FRAME can be displayed next to your funeral guest books to welcome your visitors to the wake, visitation hours, funeral, or Celebration of Life service. This memorial piece can be used with your funeral decorations and then given to the family to remember their loved one and his beautiful smile. This frame will also make a nice In Loving Memory Wedding Sign to honor someone who has passed away who was influential in your life. This can be in memory of dad or in memory of grandpa. THIS MEN'S \"HIS SMILE\" SYMPATHY GIFT is crafted for those who are grieving the loss of a husband, father, grandfather, son, or male friend. See our \"HER SMILE\" sympathy gifts that honor a wife, mother, grandma, or daughter or a female friend. Each frame will capture the smile and spirit of the loved one who has passed away. Details: Frames come in many color and size options and are available with or without the option to add your own photo to make it honor a special memory. This finished frame size is 10\"x10\" and holds an 8\"x8\" print with a picture opening that holds a 4”x6” photo for a one-of-a-kind gift. Each item is carefully packed in a custom-sized box with bubble wrap ensuring its safety during shipping. Proudly Made in the USA!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710jqQRXdrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crossroads Home Décor","source_asin":"B093YSWBYL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-910249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093YSWBYL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093YSWBYL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
