window.products.push({"id":910354,"name":"RJ Legend 8.5 oz. Mini Cocotte with Lid, Set of 3 Small Dutch Oven for Baking, Enameled Cast Iron Ramekin, 0.25 Quart, Green/White/Yellow, 3 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XV4QztlfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM PRESENTATION: This mini iron cookware cast iron set comes in 3 vibrant and classy colors. The colors were expertly chosen by our designer to bring imagination to the table. Perfect cast iron set for family and parties where each person can have his own individual pot mini dishes. Serves as a great holiday cast iron cookware gift for your loved ones! With its compact size, this set is easy to store. Your package comes with a Recipe Card and a Registry Card! MULTI-FUNCTIONAL COOKING: Unleash your cooking creativity with the versatile 0.25 Quart Cast Iron Pot for each! This enameled cookware is oven safe up to 500F and can be used on a variety of cooktops, including gas, electric, ceramic, and induction. For the best results, use low to medium heat and add water or oil. This enameled iron pot is not recommended for use in a microwave. Add this must-have kitchen essential to your collection today and take your cooking to the next level! HIGH HEAT RETENTION: Savor every bite with the Cast Iron Pot, the perfect choice for delicious and hot meals! Its excellent heat retention and distribution ensures that your food stays hot for longer. The extra-heavy cooking lid seals in moisture, delivering mouth-watering results every time. Safe and simple to use, this cast iron pot is an essential kitchen tool for all your cooking needs. PRACTICAL CLEANING: Experience effortless cooking and easy cleaning with this premium enameled cast iron pot! The 3 layers of enamel coating ensure that food won't react or leave any unwanted flavors or odors. With its non-stick finish, cleaning up is a breeze, making it the perfect choice for busy home cooks and food enthusiasts alike. EASY TO CARE: Keep your enameled cast iron cookware in top shape with simple care instructions. Wash and dry before first use and hand wash with warm soapy water for best results. Safe for the dishwasher, but avoid using metal utensils to prevent scratching.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XV4QztlfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RJ Legend","source_asin":"B08P54SX8C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-910354","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P54SX8C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P54SX8C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
