window.products.push({"id":910552,"name":"Porthos Home Patia Faux Fur Chair with Luxurious Mongolian Faux Fur Upholstery, Adjustable Height, 360° Swivel and Roller Wheels (Great As an Office C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NceWXBQwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Porthos Home Patia faux fur chair - not every office chair has to be boring If you like words such as “attitude”, “unconventional” and “fun” to describe your office chair, you’ll be charmed by the Patia. It sticks out (in a good way) Being like the rest doesn’t quite suit the Patia fuzzy desk chair. With fluffy Mongolian faux fur upholstery that screams “fun!” more than it says “work”, it’s destined for someone who isn’t afraid to be different at work, and knows how to balance mundane work hours with adequate doses of fun. Ergonomic like a regular office chair too The Patia fluffy desk chair isn’t all just about looks either. It’s serious about ergonomics too, since you’re likely going to spend at least 8 hours sitting on it. Its instant adjustable height lets you sit up straight and comfortable at any desk. This means posture-related ailments such as strained neck, stiff shoulders and backaches can be minimized. Great multi-tasker The Patia fuzzy chairs help you multi-task like a pro too - even while you’re seated. Its 360° swivel gives you total freedom to turn in every direction while its roller wheels will glide you smoothly over to the photocopier or water dispenser - seamless! Features of Porthos Home Patia furry desk chairs: Instant adjustable height 360° swivel Sturdy roller wheels Mongolian faux fur upholstery 2 colors to choose from Dimensions: (height) 31.9-36.64 x (width) 19.3 x (length/depth) 21.76 inches Weight: 14.1 lbs Simple assembly required 1-year warranty for your peace of mind Your satisfaction is important to us. That’s why we offer a 1-year warranty on these Porthos Home Patia furry chairs so you can get timely help if you’ve issues with your purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NceWXBQwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Porthos Home","source_asin":"B082D89V69","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-910552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082D89V69","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082D89V69","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
