window.products.push({"id":910625,"name":"Scented Candle for Home Taroko Orange 12 oz Large Jar Transparent Essential Oil Jelly Candle (Gift Box) Aromatherapy Candle Decorative Candle Scented ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617yev08udL._AC_SL1220_.jpg","description":"Beautiful & Unique jelly scented candle. It is a highly decorative scented candle. Double glass. Only the interior of the scented candles can be ignited. The dried flower part is combustible, pay attention to safety. We look forward to bring warmth and romance to your home. Material: Jelly Wax + Essential Oil + Preserved Flowers + Gold Foil Burning time: About 45 Hours Weight: 400g(0.88Pounds) Package Include: 1 × Scented Candle Warmly Notice: The candle should be stored in a cool, dark and dry place. Excessive temperature or direct sunlight will cause the surface of the candle to melt, which will affect the degree of fragrance of the candle, resulting in insufficient fragrance emission when lit. Sunffed out the candles 1. Always remember that you can't blow out the candles with your mouth. This will not only damage the candles, but also produce black smoke. 2. You can use the candle extinguishing tool to immerse the candle wick in wax oil,and then straighten the cotton core immediately,or use the candle extinguishing cover to extinguish the candle. Do remember.Do not blow out the candles avoid producing black smoke. 3. Please stop burning when the candle is less than 1cm. Light Candles: 1. Before lighting the candle, trim the wick of the candle by 5-8 mm. 2. When burning the candle for the first time, please continue to burn for 2-3 hours, so that the wax around the wick is evenly heated and the surface is completely me lted. After that, the burning of the candle will only be limited to the wick. Increase the burnning time.  3. Always pay attention to keeping the length of the candle wick within 5-8 mm. Trimming the candle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617yev08udL._AC_SL1220_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VISIKOM","source_asin":"B09NW8LPCS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-910625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NW8LPCS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NW8LPCS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
