window.products.push({"id":910815,"name":"Cactus Set of 4 Leatherette Round Coasters w/Silver Edge (Personalized)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+AupltINL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"While our guests bring joy into our home, their drinks can also leave behind those dreaded marks on our beloved counter-tops and table surfaces. Protect your surfaces with our drink coasters! And with your vibrant personalization atop your new coasters, your guests will prefer to use them!Made from a cognac-brown leatherette, these personalized coasters are durable, while maintaining a sophisticated, classy appearance. These table coasters are encircled with a silver-colored, plastic ring. In your palm, these will feel a bit more weighted and substantial than the average coaster. They measure at 3.75 by 3.75 inches, and can therefore hold most average-sized drinks. Ultimately, your customization will be laser-engraved into the face of the leatherette, leaving behind a refined black finish. These can be purchased singularly or in a set of 4.As with our other leatherette products, you can clean these by wiping them down with a wet cloth and any light detergent.Design Shown: Cactus (#1057170)Features:==================================== * [High-quality Material]: Cognac-brown leatherette for a sophisticated, classy appearance. * [Silver Edge]: Silver-colored plastic ring adds elegance and style to the coaster. * [Size and Shape]: Round 3.75\" x 3.75\" dimensions, suitable for most average-sized drinks. * [Flexible Quantity]: Available for purchase as a single coaster or in a set of 4.Care Instructions:==================================== * Wipe with lightly dampened cloth to clean * Allow to air dry","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+AupltINL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YouCustomizeIt","source_asin":"B07JCB6GJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-910815","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JCB6GJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JCB6GJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
