window.products.push({"id":910829,"name":"VOTOWN HOME Throw Blanket Sherpa Throw Queen Size 60\"x80\" Flannel Fleece Comfy Reversible Blanket Lightweight Soft Thick Warm Blanket for Bed/Couch/Gi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sj89AlU+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Material】Dual Sided Super Soft Blanket is made of a soft flannel face and a plush Sherpa. The front is smooth fleece(220gsm)and the back is a shaggy, white, fluffy sherpa material(260gsm). It feels like lying on pure wool and making it the perfect accent for any bed, sofa or chair. This blanket is anti-pilling, wrinkle free, hypoallergenic, and does not shed. 【Size& Colors】It comes in 12 different colors and is available in 2 sizes. Votown Plush Winter blanket have size in 50\" x 60\" inches and Twin Size 60\"x80\" inches, which big enough to covers your whole body and will keep you warm all winter long. The warmth and softness of a fleece winter blanket can help soothe you to sleep and keep you sleeping more comfortably throughout a cold night. 【Multi Usage Scenarios】Votown flannel fleece blankets are ideal for indoor and outdoor. Using soft and smooth material, not too thin, you feel really warm when you put in on. They are especially popular with children. Fleece is good at wicking away moisture, another benefit when used on a child’s bed. Also It’s perfect for lazy Sundays, sick days, or even movie nights with the whole family. 【Attractive Gift Package】Our blankets make awesome gifts for mother, sister, aunt, teacher, wife , best friend or whole family. Also it’s Perfect choice for holidays gift, Mother Day's Gift, Thanksgiving gift, Christmas gift. 【Care Instruction】Easy care fabric with minimal shrinkage. To ensure years of cozy comfort, wash the blanket in mild detergent and cool or lukewarm water with similar colors. Do not wash or dry with towels, sweaters or other fabrics that might pill or get fibers caught in the Sherpa fabric.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sj89AlU+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VOTOWN HOME","source_asin":"B07DBYSVNR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-910829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DBYSVNR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DBYSVNR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":910830,"name":"Omega Nutrition Center Juicer (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":180.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ddseYPv1L._AC_SL1056_.jpg","description":"Omega Nutrition Center Model 8003 - White Wheatgrass, Fruit, Vegetable Juicer and more! Features & SpecificationsThe Omega 8003 Nutrition Center Juicer is quick, efficient and affordable compared to most! The Omega Juicer Model 8003 provides an easy solution for multi-purpose functions not just limited to juicing. It is easy to clean, carries a lengthy 10-Year Warranty and comes in at a decent price for all the functions it can accomplish. The Omega name has been around for more than 30 years and continues to produce a high quality machine. The Omega 8003 Juicer replaces the older Omega 8001 and 8002 models. Low revolution auger speedThe Omega Juicer 8003 has a slow turning 80 RPM auger which preserves nutrients longer than high revolution juicers.While some people may be concerned that this means it juices very slowly the speed difference is not all that noticeable. The extra time is well spent in preserving all of the nutrients in the juice and creating a much better tasting juice too!QualityWhile the price tag may seem high - consider the fact that this juicer has a 10-Year Warranty. We have clients who have had their juicer (older models) for 10-20 years without having any problems. All of the parts on this machine are built to last with no loose ends (they fit together solidly!) Functions:Vegetable juicer! - Kale, beets, wheatgrass, spinach, yams, leafy greens, pine needles, arrowroots, carrots, peppers, radishes and moreFruit juicer! - Apples, pears, peaches, carrots, oranges, grapes, kiwi, melon, tomatoes, and more. Does an excellent job on both hard and soft fruits.Meat / Fish Mincer - Mince and chop just about anything! Seasonings Chopper / Mincer - Minces onion, scallion, garlic, red pepper, ginger radish and so much more!Soy milk - make fresh soymilk!Nut buttersPasta extruder - homemade spaghetti, linguini, and breadsticksFrozen dessertsMincing / ChoppingGrinding - grind coffee beans and flourBaby foodsWheatgrass juicer and leafy greensFeatures","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ddseYPv1L._AC_SL1056_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Omega Juicers","source_asin":"B000KHPFFI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-910830","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000KHPFFI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000KHPFFI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
