window.products.push({"id":910996,"name":"Custom Beatles Mr. Kite Poster/JohnLennon-Paul McCartney/SGT. Pepper's Loney Hearts Club Band/Vintage/Digitally Restored/Artwork Quality Print/Premium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gDRiY4Y4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Poster Details: John Lennon purchased the 19th-century circus poster for Pablo Fanque’s Circus Royal in an antique store in 1967, while the Beatles were filming Strawberry Fields Forever and Penny Lane. Everything in the Beatles song was adapted from the poster, except the name of the horse was not Henry, but Zanthus. What is The “hogshead of real fire” ? A colloquial term for a barrel set alight. One of the most musically complex songs from Sgt. Pepper, the Abbey Road production team used a harmonium of wobbly tapes of vintage Victorian calliopes and the Hammond organ to create the song’s famous kaleidoscopic wash of sound.  Stepped in history, Lennon was unaware the poster bill promoted the biggest stars in the Victorian Age. Pablo Fanque, born William Darby, was a master horseman and the first black circus owner. The circus played to capacity crowds for the better part of 30 years. Mr. Kite was William Kite,who worked for Pablo Fanque from 1843-1845, visible on the poster playing the bugle while balancing on his head a top a pole. J. Henderson was John Henderson, a famous wire-walker, equestrian, trampoline artist, and clown. He performed acts with his wife Agnes. Three Paper Quality Options Available: We use high quality 100% premium paper with a lifespan of 25-400yrs. The finish is dependent on the contrast range of the print and how it is affected by the light striking it.  Economical Print: Premium Poster Paper. The unique quality is suitable for framing. Ideal for theater type posters. The white on this paper is a little warmer and darker than the C-Prints.  C-Print Matte: The surface is more satin then high-gloss. Excellent for photos and artwork.  Enhanced Matte Paper is recommended to be displayed behind glass or laminating for maxim life. Highest quality wood fiber matte paper. Best for framed artwork or reproductions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gDRiY4Y4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Custom Promotions","source_asin":"B087DNSHB5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-910996","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087DNSHB5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087DNSHB5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":910997,"name":"Sponge Holder Sink Caddy, Adhesive Sink Basket Brush Holder Dish Cloth Hanger Soap Rack , Dish Rack in-Sink Sponge Kitchen Organizer No Drilling","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517hkA4M1YL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Do you want to make the kitchen countertop look clean and tidy? Need to replace your existing suction sponge holder which always fall off? Need to find a Stainless Steel construction sink sponge holder? Versatile 3 in 1 Sponge Holder Sink Caddy can provide you with different experience. Mount this stainless-steel holder by the sink wherever sponges, soap, and brushes steel wool, are needed in the house, in an RV where you need them. Keep countertops clear, no more mess around the sink Where to use: only stick on smooth hard surfaces. DON'T stick on painted walls or wallpapers as it will take off your paint or wallpapers. How to use 1. Clean the area where the adhesive installed. 2. Peel off the protective cover on the back, install the adhesive and press firmly to squeeze air out. 3. Hang the shelf on the hook. It can be used 5 hours after installation. 4.Instead of using a sink organizer caddy that’s lying in dirty water, a good stainless steel sponge caddy helps you organize and saves your limited kitchen space, keeps your kitchen accessories clean. 5. No drilling required, it’s a easy job to install the kitchen sink organizer rack. The adhesive is waterproof and strong enough to put dish liquid soap in the caddy. How to remove: You can use a hair dryer to heat the adhesive surface, then tear off the installed adhesive.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517hkA4M1YL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N/A/A","source_asin":"B08RBRX7XC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-910997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RBRX7XC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RBRX7XC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
